Package: metricpower
Type: Package
Title: Sample Size and Power for AI Performance Metrics
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person("Theo", "Wu", email = "tw73@rice.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Sampling variances and sample-size calculations for the
    performance metrics used to evaluate medical-imaging AI. Metrics whose
    sample size is already solved by an established package are routed to it
    (the L4 layer); metrics whose variance is published or elementary but not
    inverted to a sample size anywhere are implemented here (the L3 layer),
    across five estimator families: functions of a confusion matrix,
    multiclass averages, count rates, per-case means, and U-statistics.
    Every implemented variance is validated against simulation.
